# Source: Fakhreddin Azimi, Iran: The Crisis of Democracy, 1941–1953,
# chs. 5–6, especially pp. 250–267. Mechanical effects are counterfactual
# abstractions.
title: <span class="term term-nationalist-social-democratic">Khalil Maleki</span>
new-page: true
